{"page":20165,"part":1,"text":"　　 第七 直法\n\n　　 垂露， 首抢上，尾抢上，分四停各半之。\n\n　　 悬针， 首抢上，尾抢下，空出分五停，上二下一。\n\n　　 向 首抢左上右，右上左，昆抢左上左，右上右，偏蹲偏驻，侧抢侧过，分五停，上二 下二。\n\n　　 背 与向反。\n\n　　 努 首抢右筑锋，尾抢上，左衄讫趯出，分七停，上一下一，藏趯亦可。\n\n　　 □ <亻壹> 首抢中心，上出，字分尽处空中落下，画分尽处蹲之。尾抢上出空中，力尽止，垂露、悬针、向、背、努等笔皆有之，肥瘠以字分为称，长短随偏傍所宜用。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20165,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"fe282aa6faa369b6e3aaac065f1ef11d649b7494dc1fe0c9655f3b39808f8bc0","textSha256":"fe282aa6faa369b6e3aaac065f1ef11d649b7494dc1fe0c9655f3b39808f8bc0","fileSha256":"fe282aa6faa369b6e3aaac065f1ef11d649b7494dc1fe0c9655f3b39808f8bc0","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20165-work-127.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"翰林要诀 · 第七直法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":8,"sourceTextSha256":"b55d31d548ec9ee24a5c6de2c137bd0ac34cb8320cc87c4c7dad5cb6979801ff","id":"word-翰林要诀-62","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"直法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":8},{"start":10,"end":32,"sourceTextSha256":"e66b7895ba8dad55db13db0686b63fde5b65c984115520ff8f4731358077af6d","id":"word-翰林要诀-63","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"直法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":22},{"start":34,"end":60,"sourceTextSha256":"b0616c1b244a992c098847d3de2ae16c8b7f3c6b332595bd323cce3aa25a35fd","id":"word-翰林要诀-64","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"直法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":26},{"start":62,"end":107,"sourceTextSha256":"64b637c0bf9f67f24358c001660